  "_comment": [
    "Seal Cascade hunting-contract master data. NOT loaded by the server.",
    "",
    "This is the single source of truth for the campaign's hunting layer. It is",
    "the build input for tools/gen-hunts.py, which emits three artifacts:",
    "  1. the Drops: blocks in db/quest_db.conf",
    "  2. npc/custom/dm_campaign/shared/dm_hunts.txt (the script-side table)",
    "  3. korangar/src/world/library/campaign_quests.tsv (the client quest log)",
    "Run 'tools/gen-hunts.py --check' to verify the three are in sync.",
    "",
    "'budget' is the intended number of monster kills for the whole contract.",
    "The generator derives each Drops: Rate from budget and count; do not hand-",
    "edit rates. Quest drops are a bonus ON TOP of the monster's natural drop",
    "(src/map/quest.c:335) and roll per party member in range (src/map/mob.c:3046).",
    "",
    "Items are ordinary tradeable RO drops on purpose: a contract can be filled",
    "by hunting, by buying, or by a party pooling what it already has."
